
# CIMCMS LED Controller V1

## Hardware

- ESP32 DevKit V1
- PCF8574 Keypad: 0x20
- PCF8574 Odd Relay Bank: 0x21
- PCF8574 Even Relay Bank: 0x22
- SSD1306 OLED: 0x3C
- DS3231 RTC: 0x68
- WS2812: 24 LEDs, GPIO18

## GPIO

- SDA: GPIO21
- SCL: GPIO22
- WS2812 Data: GPIO18

## Relay Mapping

Odd bank 0x21:
- P0 = Relay 1
- P1 = Relay 3
- P2 = Relay 5
- P3 = Relay 7
- P4 = Relay 9
- P5 = Relay 11
- P6 = Relay 13
- P7 = Relay 15

Even bank 0x22:
- P0 = Relay 2
- P1 = Relay 4
- P2 = Relay 6
- P3 = Relay 8
- P4 = Relay 10
- P5 = Relay 12
- P6 = Relay 14
- P7 = Relay 16

## Relay software development

All 16 relay channels are enabled. The default development backend is software simulation; no relay PCF8574 hardware is required to test relay state logic. Set RELAY_SIMULATION_MODE to false when beginning physical PCF8574 integration.

## Keypad

- Enter two digits from 01 to 16.
- # confirms and toggles the selected relay.
- * cancels.
- A = Manual.
- B = Maintenance.
- C = Auto (not yet implemented).
- D = Experiment (after the combo timeout).
- D, #, # = Start Wi-Fi setup hotspot.

## Development status

Local hardware control is implemented.
Wi-Fi, MQTT, scheduling, NTP and persistent
configuration are planned integration phases.

Disconnect mains loads during development testing.
